+- VER-PHIARITY-1 refined: the contract is two-sided
+  (reachable ⊆ named ⊆ static) in both the GLA verifier and the CCC_VALIDATE_SSA
+  PHI-ARITY check — the equality-with-reachable first cut false-positived on
